index 0000000000..0c1720dbb6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/l3-router-type-change-recreate-948c3e8871714120.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    When a router's ``ha`` or ``distributed`` flag no longer matched the
+    router cached by the L3 agent, the agent replaced the cached router
+    with a new one that was never initialized and left the old router's
+    processes running. A router with an IPv6 subnet then failed to process
+    and ran without radvd. The agent now deletes the stale router and adds
+    it again.
